{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Dream, I dream a dream of you
A [Bb]tiny dancer in a field of blue
A [C]pointed toe Tchaikovsky [F]play
To [G]bend you down so [C]lowly
It's your [C]raven hair that makes me mad
Your [Bb]insane eyes that make me sad
The [C]California feeling and the Mississippi [F]smile
That [G]makes me come on [C]slowly
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
